{"frases": [{"a": 0, "b": 2.995, "t": "If your coffee tastes bitter, stop fixing it with sugar.", "k": ["bitter,"], "w": [0.056, 0.215, 0.474, 0.833, 1.192, 1.625, 1.884, 2.243, 2.403, 2.662]}, {"a": 2.995, "b": 5.073, "t": "Almost nobody knows there's another way.", "k": ["there's"], "w": [3.045, 3.404, 3.763, 4.072, 4.43, 4.839]}, {"a": 5.073, "b": 7.606, "t": "And it's probably already in your kitchen.", "k": ["probably"], "w": [5.123, 5.332, 5.541, 6.0, 6.408, 6.568, 6.827]}, {"a": 7.606, "b": 10.665999999999999, "t": "When coffee turns bitter, most people reach for sugar.", "k": ["bitter,"], "w": [7.656, 7.908, 8.258, 8.558, 8.98, 9.233, 9.582, 9.883, 10.086]}, {"a": 10.665999999999999, "b": 12.082999999999998, "t": "Sugar adds sweetness on top.", "k": ["sweetness"], "w": [10.716, 11.004, 11.245, 11.719, 11.868]}, {"a": 12.082999999999998, "b": 14.395999999999999, "t": "But the bitter taste is still in the cup.", "k": ["bitter"], "w": [12.133, 12.328, 12.523, 12.857, 13.145, 13.294, 13.582, 13.73, 13.925]}, {"a": 14.395999999999999, "b": 18.756, "t": "In 1997, scientists in Philadelphia tested a different idea.", "k": ["1997,"], "w": [14.446, 14.629, 15.473, 16.113, 16.295, 17.049, 17.46, 17.585, 18.168]}, {"a": 18.756, "b": 22.078, "t": "They gave 21 volunteers drinks that mixed bitter and sweet,", "k": ["21"], "w": [18.806, 19.061, 19.316, 19.728, 20.278, 20.631, 20.886, 21.191, 21.544, 21.75]}, {"a": 22.078, "b": 24.136, "t": "and asked them to rate each one.", "k": ["asked"], "w": [22.128, 22.334, 22.638, 22.893, 23.05, 23.305, 23.56]}, {"a": 24.136, "b": 26.192999999999998, "t": "Now the other way almost nobody knows,", "k": ["almost"], "w": [24.186, 24.397, 24.608, 24.92, 25.132, 25.494, 25.856]}, {"a": 26.192999999999998, "b": 28.596, "t": "the one that's already in your kitchen.", "k": ["kitchen."], "w": [26.243, 26.454, 26.665, 26.977, 27.39, 27.551, 27.812]}, {"a": 28.596, "b": 29.919999999999998, "t": "You don't need a new machine.", "k": ["machine."], "w": [28.646, 28.827, 29.051, 29.276, 29.37, 29.552]}, {"a": 29.919999999999998, "b": 32.026, "t": "And you don't need more expensive coffee.", "k": ["expensive"], "w": [29.97, 30.151, 30.332, 30.556, 30.781, 31.005, 31.445]}, {"a": 32.026, "b": 34.906000000000006, "t": "The scientists added a kind of salt to those bitter drinks.", "k": ["scientists"], "w": [32.076, 32.252, 32.72, 32.98, 33.072, 33.29, 33.424, 33.641, 33.775, 34.035, 34.336]}, {"a": 34.906000000000006, "b": 36.138000000000005, "t": "The bitterness dropped.", "k": ["bitterness"], "w": [34.956, 35.162, 35.712]}, {"a": 36.138000000000005, "b": 39.536, "t": "And the drinks even tasted sweeter, without any extra sugar.", "k": ["sweeter,"], "w": [36.188, 36.394, 36.601, 36.954, 37.209, 37.563, 38.039, 38.441, 38.648, 38.952]}, {"a": 39.536, "b": 42.846000000000004, "t": "That's because sodium blocks part of the bitter signal on your tongue.", "k": ["because"], "w": [39.586, 39.846, 40.189, 40.491, 40.793, 41.01, 41.144, 41.32, 41.622, 41.924, 42.058, 42.276]}, {"a": 42.846000000000004, "b": 44.616, "t": "In coffee, a tiny pinch is enough.", "k": ["coffee,"], "w": [42.896, 43.047, 43.459, 43.563, 43.809, 44.103, 44.254]}, {"a": 44.616, "b": 46.666000000000004, "t": "You shouldn't taste the salt at all.", "k": ["shouldn't"], "w": [44.666, 44.865, 45.3, 45.594, 45.793, 46.039, 46.19]}, {"a": 46.666000000000004, "b": 48.412000000000006, "t": "So next time your coffee is bitter,", "k": ["bitter,"], "w": [46.716, 46.863, 47.103, 47.343, 47.582, 47.914, 48.061]}, {"a": 48.412000000000006, "b": 50.606, "t": "try a pinch of salt before the sugar.", "k": ["before"], "w": [48.462, 48.656, 48.757, 49.043, 49.19, 49.43, 49.762, 49.955]}, {"a": 50.606, "b": 53.037000000000006, "t": "Tell me if you'd dare to put salt in your coffee.", "k": ["coffee."], "w": [50.656, 50.901, 51.051, 51.201, 51.446, 51.69, 51.841, 52.038, 52.283, 52.433, 52.678]}, {"a": 53.037000000000006, "b": 56.56, "t": "Follow for one coffee curios